{
  "about": "Every line of the connect wire (internal/connectwire). Each case's line is the exact bytes on the socket, without the newline. kind is hello, hello_reply, request or response; a response's shape names its result type (status, started, waited, secret, pending, choices, company_draft, company_checked, company_published, done) and is empty for an error. Go round-trips each line byte-identically; the Swift ConnectWire decodes the same file.",
